 So it's like this sort of famous, um, in paranormal circles, alternative research circles,

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:01.340
 it's sort of this like famous canard about the Russians destroying the Ukraine when, or

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.220
 Ukraine, excuse me.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.020
 And that really hasn't happened.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.340
 Um, okay.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.620
 So yeah, that's Thomas Bearden Jr.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:07.980
 Right.

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:12.760
 So the reason that I bring that up, because of course there are, there are a couple of

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:13.420
 things here, right?

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:17.920
 So there's, there's your connection to big oil and I, and I don't mean that disrespectfully.

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.420
 I'm saying like, that was your career, right?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.320
 Oh yeah, absolutely.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:28.920
 And so the way that might inform the, the approach you have to the community, there's a connection

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.020
 to the intelligence community.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.920
 And then that doesn't make you unique.

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:37.860
 Um, I think that everyone else here and myself might be the only people in ufology who aren't

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.660
